{"id":"moving-on-express","parentId":"prototypes","showOnRoot":false,"layout":"folder","windowWidth":"748px","windowHeight":"506px","textWidth":"62ch","body":"","showOverview":true,"showFolderActions":true,"blocks":[{"id":"moe-gameplay","type":"youtube","width":"full","heading":"My first game, made in one week","body":"","source":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3H-sLyd_h6g","mediaRef":"youtube-moving-on-express","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"Moving On Express gameplay","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"moe-story","type":"text","width":"full","heading":"Learning by shipping","body":"Moving On Express was my first game and my first time using Unity, Bolt and MagicaVoxel. I built almost everything—from the game design and voxel assets to the mechanical and technical implementation—in one week. The soundtrack was created by CillianCreates.\n\nYou play a mover loading a family’s belongings into a truck under a time limit. Speed matters, but damaged property comes out of your paycheck. It is a small idea, but shipping it taught me more than another month of abstract preparation would have.","source":"","mediaRef":"","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"","fit":"cover"},{"id":"moe-still","type":"image","width":"full","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/Graphics/3DPractice/movingonexpress.webp","mediaRef":"media-graphics-3dpractice-movingonexpress-webp","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"Movingonexpress portfolio artifact","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"moe-itch-1","type":"image","width":"half","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/MovingOnExpress/itch-screenshot-01.png","mediaRef":"","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"Moving On Express house and moving truck gameplay","fit":"cover"},{"id":"moe-itch-2","type":"image","width":"half","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media